  "claim_boundary": "This source-pinned, failure-inclusive development packet measures two generic relations on P0020's immutable fourth disjoint 20 ARC-AGI-1 plus 20 ARC-AGI-2 filename-only cohort. `adjacent_bilateral_cellwise_combine` splits exactly two adjacent equal panels, learns one aligned finite color-pair-to-output table exclusively from visible demonstrations, rejects conflicting orientations, and returns no partial value for an unseen test pair. `distinct_nonbackground_scale` derives the current grid's unique modal background and dynamically expands every cell by the number of distinct non-background colors; it refuses tied-background or factor-less grids. P0020's `4/40` source-pinned baseline is the same-cohort pre-change denominator. This is development evidence only, not independent transfer evidence and not an ARC-AGI-1 or ARC-AGI-2 solver claim. The live controller receives only visible training input/output examples and test inputs. It receives no task ID, imported cohort metadata, GT feature contract, GT solver, historical decomposition, or held-out output before committing a complete grid. P0020's baseline bytes and reports remain immutable; P0021 results may not retune this frozen controller or its operator vocabulary.",
